in high-profile divorce cases.

329
00:24:44.400 --> 00:24:46.265
And there's the custody of the children.

330
00:24:46.527 --> 00:24:50.270
The father is a drug addict
who cannot tie his own shoes.

331
00:24:50.781 --> 00:24:53.989
